ng man taking photos of seemingly ordinary spots around town.\n\nIntrigued by Kage’s actions, Hinata decides to go on a city-walking adventure with him! As they stroll together, the ordinary city she once found boring begins to reveal unexpected charm… and wonders! If you walk through a seemingly mundane town with the right person, the world bursts with fascinating colors!\n\nA city-walking romantic comedy featuring a socially savvy female university student and a young man aspiring to be a professional manga assistant!","year":2025,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Adventure","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/6f81b440-3ece-4d24-ac12-1d460a1a3ca3/13f71e92-5ba0-4434-bf6c-cd522312ca2f.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","es-la","vi","id"],"lane":"manga","rating":9.21,"follows":7718,"listAt":"2026-10-28T05:50:20.871Z","chapters":[{"id":"f89013e8-fac7-4cd9-abb0-1451117b919e","number":"16","volume":"3","title":"An Edo Stroll at a Cultural Center","lang":"en","pages":22,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T20:27:13+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"6657eff8-4661-484e-9d95-53de9fd460cf","number":"15","volume":"3","title":"There Might Be a Concrete Block Wall Near You, Too","lang":"en","pages":22,"createdAt":"2026-09-24T21:59:08+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"fbddf27c-435b-4152-9c92-0aff200b83cc","number":"14","volume":"3","title":"The Culvert Detective","lang":"en","pages":27,"createdAt":"2026-09-10T20:01:22+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"34c29b8f-c81c-4f9e-9a64-487175349069","number":"13.6","volume":"2","title":"Announcement Illustration for Volume 2","lang":"en","pages":2,"createdAt":"2026-08-26T14:33:57+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"268fe664-2c56-4f2f-8619-2aaab94e66a9","number":"13.5","volume":"2","title":"Vending Machine Collection","lang":"en","pages":9,"createdAt":"2026-08-12T19:29:53+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"8cb8c22e-2f98-4996-aa5f-b346fcb8c311","number":"13","volume":"2","